Added page-level view stories rendering a Document and a News Item through Volto's `DefaultView`, with every block the add-on ships composed in one `blocks_layout`. Block stories show each block alone; these show the spacing between them, the container widths, and the `#page-document` container that several listing rules are scoped to. The fixture seeds the querystring results the listing block would otherwise fetch, so it renders real cards without a backend. @ericof
